# Vector images (reference/components/image.md). Page area of 260 × 260 from (20, 20). The SVG files in
# resources/images/test: shapes.svg of 200 × 100 px (150 × 75 pt, ratio 2) and label.svg, without
# width or height and with viewBox="0 0 160 48" (120 × 36 pt, ratio 10/3). They are sized, take
# part in page breaks and are placed like a PNG; only the painting changes, which is vector.
#
# Page 1: title (12) and its margin of 8. art measures its natural size (150 × 75) at 40 and leaves another
# margin of 8; scaled, with Width: 100%, measures 260 × 130 (the ratio gives the height) at 40 + 75 + 8 =
# 123 and ends at 253, and its margin leaves the next one at 261. label (36) does not fit in what remains
# (280 − 261 = 19) and moves whole to page 2.
# Page 2: label at 20, of 120 × 36, with its margin of 8. row starts at 64: mini has Height: 30,
# so its width is 30 × 2 = 60; banner, with Grow, takes up what remains (260 − 60 − 10 = 190) and
# with both axes declared the image covers the box (Fit: fill). md turns the lone image in
# its paragraph into an Image of its natural size (150 × 75) and the paragraph goes below: md measures 75 + 12.
# logo: a Page overlay in the top right corner, of 12 × 6, on both pages.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 300
		Margin: 20
	Title: Imágenes vectoriales
	Language: es
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Section:
		Page overlay:
			Offset: -16 0 auto auto
			Image: test/shapes.svg
				Id: logo
				Box:
					Width: 12
		Text: Imágenes vectoriales
			Id: title
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Image: test/shapes.svg
			Id: art
			Alt: Un paisaje con montañas y un sol
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Image: test/shapes.svg
			Id: scaled
			Alt: El mismo paisaje a todo el ancho
			Box:
				Width: 100%
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Image: test/label.svg
			Id: label
			Alt: Rótulo del taller
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Stack:
			Id: row
			Gap: 10
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
			Item:
				Image: test/shapes.svg
					Id: mini
					Box:
						Height: 30
			Item:
				Grow: 1
				Image: test/label.svg
					Id: banner
					Fit: fill
					Box:
						Height: 30
		Markdown:
			Id: md
			Content >>
				![Paisaje](test/shapes.svg)

				Texto después del dibujo.
